# The installation record is per-machine and describes THIS deployment: absolute
# paths, the Node version, which hosts are configured, and the v1.1 service
# account's UPN. It holds no credential VALUE by construction -- that is checked
# before the file is written -- but a UPN is an estate identifier, and the file is
# regenerated by any run of the installer. Nothing is gained by tracking it, and a
# public release would otherwise carry someone's domain name in it.
state/

# Emitted host snippets and companion notes (-HostOutDir). Generated output.
out/
